00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
Traceability links need → requirement → design choice → verification evidence. It reveals missing proof.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
If a requirement has no test or analysis method attached, its verification path is incomplete.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Traceability chain

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
